# Keep the repo LF everywhere, whatever the checkout platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ...except this fixture, which is CRLF *on purpose*: test/smoke.test.ts
# asserts that a write preserves CRLF line endings, so normalising it on
# checkout would quietly break that test on a fresh clone. `-text` means
# "never convert". Matched by wildcard because gitattributes patterns can't
# escape the space in the filename.
**/CRLF*.md -text
